    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d852">

                <pb facs="0730" n="720" sameAs="frus:frus1949v08/pg720"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.01/12–1549</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Ambassador</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Koo</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Chinese Ambassador presents his compliments to the Secretary of State and has
                    the honor to inform him that the seat of the National Government of the Republic
                    of China has been transferred to Taipeh, Taiwan (Formosa) and that the Executive
                    Yuan and the Ministry of Foreign Affairs have been functioning there since
                    December 9, 1949.</p>
                <p>The headquarters of the Commander-in-Chief of the Military, Naval and Air Forces
                    for the purpose of directing military operations on the mainland of China are
                    now established at Sichang, Sikang Province.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-12-15">December 15,
                        1949</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
